# The company image builds from the repo root, but its Dockerfile consumes only
# the Rust workspace and the image definition. Keep this an allowlist: local
# experiments and company state can be gigabytes and must never enter BuildKit.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
!crates/**
!infra/
infra/*
!infra/company-image/
!infra/company-image/**
!infra/account-plane/
!infra/account-plane/**
# `restlessd` include_str!s this at compile time (crates/restlessd/src/context.rs:21),
# so the account-plane build fails without it. Allowlist the exact file: docs/ is
# hundreds of files and none of the rest belongs in a build context.
!docs/
docs/*
!docs/COMPANY_OPERATING_RULES.md
# The built cockpit SPA, served by the account plane. Source and node_modules
# stay out; only the build output enters the context.
!web/
web/*
!web/build/
!web/build/**
!tools/
tools/*
!tools/scenario/
!tools/scenario/restless-scenario.mjs
!tools/web-review/
!tools/web-review/restless-web-review.mjs
!tools/codex-runner/
!tools/codex-runner/restless-codex-runner.mjs
!tools/codex-runner/restless-codex-parity-preflight.mjs
!tools/codex-runner/restless-codex-task-run.mjs
!tools/codex-runner/restless-codex-longitudinal-run.mjs
